# The api image builds from the repository root, so keep build artifacts,
# dependencies and secrets out of the context that gets sent to the daemon.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/tests/coverage
**/tests/generated
.git
.github
artifacts

# never ship a real environment file into an image; templates are enough
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.template
